# Who gets in (GC-2026-0814 #2). Applicants hold a token per application; officers, branch staff and services
# hold JWTs with a role and a market, and the market in the token must match the market in the route.

@onboarding = http://localhost:5100
@screening = http://localhost:5200
@simulators = http://localhost:5300

### 1. A draft to read.
# @name create
POST {{onboarding}}/v1/markets/MB/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{ "firstName": "Test" }

### 2. No token: 401.
GET {{onboarding}}/v1/markets/MB/applications/{{create.response.body.applicationId}}

### 3. The wrong token: 401, the same answer, so the API doesn't reveal which applications exist.
GET {{onboarding}}/v1/markets/MB/applications/{{create.response.body.applicationId}}
X-Application-Token: not-the-token

### 4. The right token on the wrong market: 401.
GET {{onboarding}}/v1/markets/MA/applications/{{create.response.body.applicationId}}
X-Application-Token: {{create.response.body.applicationToken}}

### 5. Officers' cases without a token: 401.
GET {{screening}}/v1/markets/MB/cases

### 6. An MA officer on MB's cases: 403.
# @name officer
POST {{simulators}}/dev/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "role": "officer", "market": "MA" }

###
GET {{screening}}/v1/markets/MB/cases
Authorization: Bearer {{officer.response.body.accessToken}}

### 7. Branch staff on the officers' API: 403.
# @name staff
POST {{simulators}}/dev/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "role": "branch", "market": "MB" }

###
GET {{screening}}/v1/markets/MB/cases
Authorization: Bearer {{staff.response.body.accessToken}}

### 8. A market this deployment doesn't serve: 404 market.unknown.
POST {{onboarding}}/v1/markets/MZ/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{ "firstName": "Test" }

### 9. An MB identifier in MD's format: 400 with the field code, and the value isn't echoed back.
POST {{onboarding}}/v1/markets/MB/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{ "identifier": { "type": "NATIONAL_ID", "value": "1234567890", "issuingCountry": "XB" } }
